{"games":[{"id":18611199638,"name":"Guess The Gibberish","desc":"Welcome to Guess The Gibberish, THE HARDEST GUESSING GAME ON ROBLOX PERIOD. \n\n🧠 In this game you'll be shown words that sound like complete nonsense but actually mean something, Can you guess what it says?\n💸 Earn money by guessing correctly, every minute played\n🛒 Use money on hints or pets\n🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Play with friends to help you out\n\n🎮 Available on Desktop, Phones,  & Tablets\n💜 Like and Join the group for a 2,500 coins reward! - https://www.roblox.com/communities/16137142/Eggrolls-Studio\n💎 PREMIUM PLAYERS get 3X COINS + Premium Chat Tag + Sparkles Trail + Speed Coil","path":"/game/18611199638-guess-the-gibberish","slug":"18611199638-guess-the-gibberish","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3798b89df7fc55a1f07317f9c422e79f26b7e2fc400e98a983b04f46b033f7c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-69bb9d4d69a915e876408238078b8035/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":9893070,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-04T03:50:51.215Z","creator":{"name":"LostLegendaryEggroll","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8832438757,"name":"PVP Sword Fighting ⚔️🔥","desc":"The objective is simple: kill other players to steal their time; be the person with the highest time & kills. watch out for other players, they could steal your time & kills!\n\nRules can be found in the community server! We reserve the right to ban you for any reason.  Big UGC's will result in a kick based on moderator discretion. \n\nWe have a one-time appeal policy so if you were banned and would like to appeal, make an appeal and be sincere! Join the community server below!\n\nYou may get trolled\n\nEnjoy!\n\ntags: steal time from others, pvp sword fighting, 1v1 sword fights","path":"/game/8832438757-pvp-sword-fighting","slug":"8832438757-pvp-sword-fighting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/79b12128eab4f4197eea84b9e80f1af34dd1b0152a5612088822ae307c8a6d52.webp