os! Are you ready to become a hero in the ultimate police and emergency response adventure?\n\n Key Features:\n 🚔 Dynamic Police Pursuits: Chase down criminals in high-speed pursuits across England's sprawling cities and countryside. \n 🚒 Firefighting Frenzy: Battle blazes and save lives! From tackling infernos in England your firefighting skills will be put to the test. \n🚑 Paramedic Challenges: Time is of the essence! Respond to emergency calls, administer critical care, and transport patients to safety in this pulse-pounding paramedic experience.\n\n 🌍 Explore England: Discover a vast, open-world map that captures the beauty and diversity of England. Every city, street, and alleyway offers new challenges and adventures. \nPlay Today!\n\nShutdown = Update!","path":"/game/12356105815-emergency-england","slug":"12356105815-emergency-england","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1d213bc42466b6d9117dc6f78ba4adedc3b86b09990ab496374a925b315f1919.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86d1ae5b6918928913c79054772df3b1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":23664876,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-04T10:54:51.349Z","creator":{"name":"Response England!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4975865235,"name":"[⚙UPDATE] Mechanical Ascension X","desc":"You find yourself on a land with unlimited and powerful resources... for what purpose? Money, of course! Build intricate factories to extract, refine, and sell of various materials for profit, which you can then use to improve your factory more! And when you don't think you can go any farther... reset, back to the beginning! Of course, with a little (VERY, VERY BIG) something to help you get even more powerful next time...\n\nHow far can you ascend?\nWelcome to Mechanical Ascension X!\n\nJoin the group for in-game benefits, and news about updates: https://www.roblox.com/communities/581737899/Mechanical-Ascension-X#!/about","path":"/game/49758652